Package: pofinite
Type: Package
Title: Finite-Iteration Pseudo-Observation Prediction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yumei", "Yang", email = "yumeiy@email.unc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A fixed three-start finite-iteration predictor using raw risk
    pseudo-observations, a complementary log-log conditional mean, unit Gaussian
    working variance and working independence. Retains numerical diagnostics and
    selects a finite prediction endpoint using training loss. Does not construct
    pseudo-observations or provide robust standard errors or coefficient inference.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Collate: 'math.R' 'starts.R' 'solver.R' 'selection.R' 'api.R'
URL: https://github.com/Allison0802/pofinite
BugReports: https://github.com/Allison0802/pofinite/issues
